// Title: MacOS Network Service Scanning
// Rule ID: 84bae5d4-b518-4ae0-b331-6d4afd34d00f
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1046
// Category: process_creation
// Product: macos
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
